      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-11T23:20:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this have to be a PendingIntent?  (I\u0027m guessing the answer is yes but don\u0027t know enough to know why.  If it\u0027s a long answer, we can talk offline.)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2350,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 2350,
        "endChar": 49
      },
      "revId": "f8a85c9e4c532c787ae7f6e48acf831cb70b7b3b",
